# Optional: enables WalletConnect (mobile / QR-code wallet connection) in
# ConnectWalletButton, alongside the browser-injected-wallet connector that
# already works with no config. Get a project id at https://cloud.reown.com
# — an empty/fake value here just fails silently, so it's left blank rather
# than filled with a placeholder that looks real.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Required for src/lib/aark/orderly-client.ts (registration + session-key
# authorization). Aark Digital runs as a broker on top of Orderly Network's
# shared infrastructure, and every Orderly broker has its own broker_id —
# not something that can be guessed. Find it in Aark's own app (network
# tab, any request carrying a brokerId field) or Orderly's public
# broker/chain_info endpoint. See README.md, "Aark Digital integration
# status" for the full picture of what's real vs. still unconfirmed.
NEXT_PUBLIC_AARK_BROKER_ID=
